    <h2>Privacy Statement</h2>

    <p><i>Last updated: March 2026</i></p>

    <p>We keep it simple: this site fully respects your privacy.</p>

    <h3>No cookies</h3>

    <p>This website does not place a single cookie on your device. Zero. Nada. That is why you do not see a cookie banner here.</p>

    <h3>No logging</h3>

    <p>We do not store server log files. Your IP address, browser, or other data is not stored by us anywhere.</p>

    <h3>Only anonymous statistics</h3>

    <p>We use Plausible Analytics to see how many people visit our site. Plausible is a
        privacy-friendly and open-source alternative to Google Analytics. It does not place cookies, does not store
        IP addresses, and does not collect personal data. The statistics are completely anonymous and aggregated. We only see totals, never individual visitors.
        Want to know more? View the <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible's data policy</a>.</p>

    <h3>No third parties</h3>

    <p>We do not share anything with third parties and do not load external scripts or fonts that can track you.</p>

    <h3>Questions?</h3>

    <p>Contact Edwin Martin &lt;<a href="mailto:edwin@webontwikkelaar.nl">edwin@webontwikkelaar.nl</a>&gt;.</p>

